+
+This revision answers verdict F1 and F2. Both were found to survive the prior
+rework attempt: the guard fix had been applied to the orchestration layer while
+the reader beneath it still returned zero on failed `brew` reads, and the
+recovery baseline had been rebound to a newer literal rather than derived. The
+guard now tests every read explicitly under both `bash` and `zsh`, and the
+recovery baseline is derived from the installed artifact. See "Validation
